# localstack.env.example — template for localstack/.localstack.env (D-15).
#
# Copy this file to `.localstack.env` in the same directory and fill in the
# real value. `.localstack.env` is git-ignored (see ../.gitignore) and must
# never be committed — this example file is the only version tracked in git,
# and it carries no value on purpose (RESEARCH.md Pitfall 4: a committed
# placeholder is how a real token eventually gets committed).
#
# Obtain the value from a free LocalStack Hobby account:
#   1. Sign up at https://app.localstack.cloud (no cost for the Hobby tier
#      itself, but an account + token has been required to start the
#      unified localstack/localstack image meaningfully since 2026-03-23).
#   2. Go to Account -> Auth Token and copy the value.
#   3. Paste it below, with no surrounding quotes.
#
# CI consumes this same variable as an org secret, never as a checked-in
# file — see docs/localstack-service-coverage.md for the tier/coverage story.
LOCALSTACK_AUTH_TOKEN=
